SimulationType                MonteCarlo
NumberOfCycles                200000
NumberOfInitializationCycles  0
NumberOfEquilibrationCycles   200000
PrintEvery                    100

ContinueAfterCrash            yes
WriteBinaryRestartFileEvery   1000

Forcefield                    GenericMOFs
RemoveAtomNumberCodeFromLabel no
CutOffVDW                     12.0
ChargeMethod                  ewald
EwaldPrecision                1e-6
OmitAdsorbateAdsorbateCoulombInteractions no

Framework 0
FrameworkName                 ZIF_08
UnitCells   2 2 2
HeliumVoidFraction 0.52

ExternalTemperature 298
ExternalPressure  1e2 2e2 3e2 4e2 5e2 6e2 7e2 8e2 9e2 1e3 2.5e3 5e3 7.5e3 1e4 2.5e4 5e4 7.5e4 1e5 1.25e5 1.5e5 1.75e5 2e5 2.5e5 5e5 7.5e5 1e6 2e6 3e6 4e6

ComputeDensityProfile3DVTKGrid yes
WriteDensityProfile3DVTKGridEvery 1000
DensityProfile3DVTKGridPoints 150 150 150
AverageDensityOverUnitCellsVTK yes
DensityAveragingTypeVTK UnitCell

Movies yes
WriteMoviesEvery 500

